//RS // ── C40: keyword-table correctness tests ─────────────────────────────────────
//RS //
//RS // Verifies that JET_KEYWORDS tracks Source/Syntax.rs (Fix A).
//RS // is_keyword drives rename validation; wrong entries reject valid names or
//RS // allow reserved ones. These tests must pass for the bug to be fixed.
